"worst grad over tol: {worst_name} (over={worst:.2f}×)\"\n338:def test_tc_proj_dw_exact_on_own_operands():\n342:    GEMM from the operand-chain bf16 divergence (calibrates the per-tensor tol).\"\"\"\n348:    B = 128\n369:    rel = err / den\n370:    print(f\"[mbtc] ISO out_proj.weight[L1] dW: kernel vs fp32(own bf16 acts) max|err|={err:.3e} rel={rel:.3e}\")\n371:    assert rel < 5e-3, f\"proj-dW ISO rel {rel:.2e} — the dW GEMM is NOT bit-exact on its own operands (a real bug)\"\n375:def test_tc_determinism():\n376:    \"\"\"(3) A/A/A bit-identical: three TC steps from the same state produce\n383:    B = 64\n396:        assert outs[i][0] == outs[0][0], f\"loss not bit-identical: {outs[i][0]} vs {outs[0][0]}\"\n397:        assert torch.equal(outs[i][1], outs[0][1]), \"grad not bit-identical (A/A/A)\"\n398:    print(f\"[mbtc] determinism A/A/A: loss {outs[0][0]:.8f} bit-identical, grad max-Δ=0\")\n402:def test_tc_short_trajectory():\n410:    B = 64\n423:    assert all(l == l for l in losses), \"NaN in trajectory\"\n424:    assert losses[-1] < losses[0] - 0.1, f\"loss did not decrease: {losses[0]:.3f} → {losses[-1]:.3f}\"\n428:def test_tc_step_time_vs_scalar():\n438:    B = 64\n456:    tc = time_fn(lambda: mod.tc_train_step(params.clone(), tokens.to(torch.int32), targets.to(torch.int32),\n479:    _try(\"(3) determinism A/A/A\", test_tc_determinism)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6216020f-6942-429a-b727-514ca10f96ef","timestamp":"2026-06-10T23:12:57.204Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fd463caa-c309-4973-9c08-d86e058a605e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f","version":"2.1.169","gitBranch":"claude/h100-audit-maximal","slug":"delegated-hugging-quill"}
/workspace/SuperGrok1.5/claude_session_archive/projects/-workspace-SuperGrok1-5/122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f/subagents/workflows/wf_42c6c6ad-b9e/agent-a2554f93962328810.jsonl:154:{"parentUuid":"6216020f-6942-429a-b727-514ca10f96ef","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a2554f93962328810","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_018GZFvX65wbJA7yVvXwWQwK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The test gates are clear:\n- `test_tc_single_step_grad_parity`: B=128, loss rel ≤ 5e-3, every grad within tol 0.08 vs bf16-rounded fp64 oracle\n- `test_tc_proj_dw_exact_on_own_operands`: B=128, isolated out_proj.weight dW rel < 5e-3 (GEMM bit-exact on own operands)\n- `test_tc_determinism`: B=64, A/A/A bit-identical (loss + grad)\n- `test_tc_short_trajectory`: B=64, loss decreases\n- `test_tc_step_time_vs_scalar`: B=64, the speedup measurement\n\nThese use small B (64-128) and `_TC_NCTA_CAP` (memory cap). My fix must preserve all of these — especially A/A/A determinism (fixed ascending-order reduction, no float atomics) and the 0.08 grad tol. A split-K dW reduction must keep deterministic ordering.\n\nThe monitor is armed for the profiler. Let me wait for it to fire rather than poll. The profiler should finish soon."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1603,"cache_read_input_tokens":195498,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1603,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbvRhVoTcmvKUmudMZvbn","attributionAgent":"workflow-subagent","type":"assistant","uuid":"797a4130-24d2-4e96-9094-26e7b7aa7d54","timestamp":"2026-06-10T23:13:03.393Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-4-8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f","version":"2.1.169","gitBranch":"claude/h100-audit-maximal","