rain_step`'s returned grad. If my dw_biases corrupted out_proj's grad slot... but my grad-diff shows out_proj grad is CORRECT (rel 4e-3 vs scalar). \n\nSo the gate's `ref` (computed from dumped operands) must differ. The dump `tc_dump_outproj_operands` re-runs `tc_scratch_for` — let me check if it re-invokes the kernel or just reads. Let me look at the exact gate test code."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":795,"cache_creation_input_tokens":847,"cache_read_input_tokens":250018,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":847,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbvVZwSJi1MoSAd6gD4GF","attributionAgent":"workflow-subagent","type":"assistant","uuid":"bad55d96-9806-4bbf-940e-1c8c479fa710","timestamp":"2026-06-11T00:03:55.667Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-4-8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f","version":"2.1.169","gitBranch":"claude/h100-audit-maximal","slug":"delegated-hugging-quill"}
/workspace/SuperGrok1.5/claude_session_archive/projects/-workspace-SuperGrok1-5/122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f/subagents/workflows/wf_42c6c6ad-b9e/agent-add6cd61c010cc195.jsonl:341:{"parentUuid":"fc07f90e-07c4-4608-93c8-040d43a315f0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"2a6b2e9d-08e9-415a-83f8-093447182b99","agentId":"add6cd61c010cc195","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VDCJS5gYb2gcra4cjm6hLw","type":"tool_result","content":"338\tdef test_tc_proj_dw_exact_on_own_operands():\n339\t    \"\"\"(2) The output-stationary dW GEMM (K=T) is bit-exact on the kernel's OWN\n340\t    stored bf16 acts: dump dY_dyout[L1], X_ygated[L1], contract fp32 ascending-t,\n341\t    compare to the kernel's out_proj.weight[L1] grad slice. ~1e-6 isolates the dW\n342\t    GEMM from the operand-chain bf16 divergence (calibrates the per-tensor tol).\"\"\"\n343\t    from tests.hw.mamba_oracle import (mamba_param_layout, D_MODEL, D_INNER, SEQ, VOCAB, P_HEAD)\n344\t    mod = _build_tc_module()\n345\t    _disable_tf32()\n346\t    dev = \"cuda\"\n347\t    named = _eager_mamba_named(seed=7)\n348\t    B = 128\n349\t    g = torch.Generator().manual_seed(11)\n350\t    tokens = torch.randint(0, VOCAB, (B, SEQ), generator=g)\n351\t    targets = torch.randint(0, P_HEAD, (B,), generator=g)\n352\t    params = _flat(named).to(dev)\n353\t    total = int(mod.TOTAL)\n354\t    state = torch.zeros(3 * total, dtype=torch.float32, device=dev)\n355\t    _, kgrad = _run_tc_step(mod, params.clone(), tokens.to(dev), targets.to(dev),\n356\t                            state, lr=1e-3, betas=(0.9, 0.98), wd=0.0, eps=1e-8, step=1)\n357\t    kgrad = kgrad.cpu().double()\n358\t    # dump reads the CACHED GPU workspace; params is used only for device+nCTA → pass the GPU tensor.\n359\t    dY, X = mod.tc_dump_outproj_operands(params, B)   # [T*d], [T*d_inner] fp32 (CPU)\n360\t    T = B * SEQ\n361\t    dY = dY.double().reshape(T, D_MODEL)\n362\t    X = X.double().reshape(T, D_INNER)\n363\t    ref = dY.t() @ X    # [d, d_inner] — out_proj.weight[L1] grad, fp32 over the kernel's bf16 acts\n364\t    lay = mamba_param_layout()\n365\t    idx = lay[\"names\"].index(\"layers.1.out_proj.weight\")\n366\t    off, sz, shape = lay[\"offsets\"][idx], lay[\"sizes\"][idx], lay[\"shapes\"][idx]\n367\t    kg = kgrad[off:off + sz].reshape(shape)\n368\t    err = (kg - ref).abs().max().item(); den = ref.abs().max().item() + 1e-30\n369\t    rel = err / den\n370\t    print(f\"[mbtc] ISO out_proj.weight[L1] dW: kernel vs fp32(own bf16 acts) max|err|={err:.3e} rel={rel:.3e}\")\n371\t    assert rel < 5e-3, f\"proj-dW ISO rel {rel:.2e} — the dW GEMM is NOT bit-exact on its own operands (a real bug)\"\n372\t\n373\t\n374\t@_GATE\n375\tdef test_tc_determinism():\n376\t    \"\"\"(3) A/A/A bit-identical: three TC steps from the same state produce\n377\t    bit-identical (loss, grad). Fixed tile/dW/partial ownership + ascending-k/t/CTA.\"\"\"\n378\t    from tests.hw.mamba_oracle import VOCAB, P_HEAD, SEQ\n379\t    mod = _build_tc_module()\n380\t    _disable_tf32()\n381\t    dev = \"cuda\"\n382\t    named = _eager_mamba_named(seed=3)"}]},"uuid":"37b7fef3-0e23-4d97-bc29-23f444b48c0e","timestamp":"2026-06-11T00:03:56.704Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fc07f90e-07c4-4608-93c8-040d43a315f0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"122b3aee-fa74-43c0-936d-39ff1eca854f","version":"2.1.169","gitBranch":"claude/h100-audit-maximal","slug":"delegated-hugging-quill"}
