calar_train_step(params.clone(), tokens.to(torch.int32), targets.to(torch.int32),","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f11d676f-4377-4d55-8ec3-eef17111ffc5","timestamp":"2026-06-12T10:51:54.916Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3d27742b-4177-496a-ac83-a7a0bd633a5b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"80b51e31-b580-43b6-8244-fd7633ee1338","version":"2.1.173","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"sprightly-pondering-dewdrop"}
/workspace/SuperGrok1.5/claude_session_archive/projects/-/80b51e31-b580-43b6-8244-fd7633ee1338/subagents/agent-aecd237c42ad37eea.jsonl:115:{"parentUuid":"f11d676f-4377-4d55-8ec3-eef17111ffc5","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aecd237c42ad37eea","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01V49yFudhSstNncu5qKCdDh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have a complete understanding. The mamba TC test does full-cell parity (`test_tc_single_step_grad_parity`), dW isolation (`test_tc_proj_dw_exact_on_own_operands`), determinism (A/A/A), trajectory, and a timing test (`test_tc_step_time_vs_scalar`). \n\nLet me now establish the **baseline** before changing anything. I'll build both TC TUs at production scale and capture:\n1. ptxas register counts (especially mamba — the budget constraint)\n2. Baseline timing via the test/full-cell `tc_train_step` at production d=128, B=16384\n\nBut first, let me make sure I understand the full vit engine (need to see if there's truly no ring) and confirm the production launcher uses the SAME engine (so the megakernel smem struct in `fused_vit_megakernel.cuh`/`fused_mamba_megakernel.cuh` is what I size). Let me read the vit megakernel smem struct and the vit engine's epilogue once more (lines 305-347 already seen). Let me read the vit megakernel smem struct."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1189,"cache_read_input_tokens":102879,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1189,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbyEopdgfLWRMHza8ekir","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"285c39f4-3164-416a-9621-835c10516804","timestamp":"2026-06-12T10:52:01.666Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/workspace/SuperGrok1.5","sessionId":"80b51e31-b580-43b6-8244-fd7633ee1338","version":"2.